+zoom, pan, navigation, and selected-image toolbar context;
+[gallery plugin actions](../../ui/src/components/IssueImageGalleryActions.test.tsx)
+cover issue/company scope, generic-binary image uploads, and absent plugins.
+Verify wheel zoom and the optional annotation handoff against a real task image,
+including multiple revisions with identical filenames.
+
